            "speakerId": 2022,
            "speakerName": "璃彩",
            "text": "确实以杰里先生的名义，定了今天的位子没错。久等了，里边请。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7267621",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
